  "_note": "MOS 6532 RIOT (RAM-I/O-Timer), DIP-40. 1 VSS, 2-7 A5-A0, 8-15 PA0-PA7, 16 PHI2, 17-24 PB7-PB0, 25 /IRQ, 26-33 D7-D0, 34 /RES, 35 R/W, 36 A6, 37 /CS2, 38 CS1, 39 RS0/, 40 VCC. RS0/ partitions the window: low = 128 bytes RAM, high = ports/timer; the engine's decode convention wires it to A7 (6507SBC shape). Same footprint convention as the w65c02 sidecar.",
